{"version":1,"key":"quest:145","content":{"id":145,"title":"IdleDetector 是什么，使用方法","summary":"参考 https://juejin.cn/post/7618525731951034383","target":{"key":"quest:145","type":"quest","id":145},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"IdleDetector API 检测用户闲置状态","meta":"","excerpt":"Web 应用有时需要知道用户是否还在电脑前。在线协作工具想在用户离开时将状态切换为\"离开\"，游戏想把长时间不操作的玩家踢出房间释放资源，银行页面想在无人操作时自动锁定以保障安全，前端也希望在用户空闲时减少动画和轮询来降低性能开销，甚至可以配合 sendBeacon 在用户离开前批量上报积攒的埋点数据。过去开发者只能通过","target":{"key":"card:733","type":"card","id":733},"citeKey":"card:733"}],"trail":[{"time":1774865025634,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1779279344421,"tone":"milestone","text":"写下卡片","refs":[1]},{"time":1779280774114,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]}],"description":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考 https://juejin.cn/post/7618525731951034383"}],"disableDrag":false}],"createTime":1774865025634,"updateTime":1774865025634,"resolvedTime":1779280774114},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1774865025634}}